## Executive result

**BLOCKED BEFORE SOURCE PATCH.** The current implementation and live state were reviewed and the reported connection failure was reproduced without mutating production. The dashboard source was not changed because `pipeline-state.md` still says `current_stage: design`, `build: pending`, `override: false`; the code-builder contract permits source changes only within an allowed build scope.

This is not a redesign recommendation. The minimum corrective path is tests-first hardening of the existing OAuth callback, channel status API, and existing Settings/channel components after the controller records a bounded build override or build approval.

